---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Privacy policy for anuran.dev — what Anuran Roy collects, what is never collected, and how to contact for privacy questions."
  width="narrow"
>
  <header class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
      Plain-language privacy for anuran.dev, operated by Anuran Roy.
    </p>
  </header>

  <article
    class="prose prose-neutral max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-headings:font-heading prose-a:text-foreground"
  >
    <p>
      anuran.dev (<strong>A Tinkerer's Canvas</strong> by <strong>Anuran Roy</strong>)
      is a personal publishing site. There are no accounts, no paywalls, no
      trackers for advertising, and no sale of personal data. This page exists so
      people and AI agents can verify legitimacy and data handling in one place.
    </p>

    <h2>What is collected</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Server and CDN logs:</strong> Vercel and the static host retain
        standard web logs (IP, user-agent, requested path, timestamp) for
        reliability and abuse prevention. Logs are retained per the hosting
        provider's policy and are not sold.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Voluntary correspondence:</strong> If you email
        <a href="mailto:anuranroy02@gmail.com">anuranroy02@gmail.com</a>, your
        message and address are used only to reply.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Comments (optional):</strong> Blog comments via Giscus use GitHub
        Discussions. Your GitHub profile and comment content are governed by
        GitHub's policies.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What is never collected</h2>
    <p>
      No passwords, no payment details, no precise geolocation, no cross-site
      advertising identifiers, and no authenticated API keys — because anuran.dev
      offers no authenticated product. The public JSON API at
      <a href="/api">/api</a> and the OpenAPI spec at
      <a href="/openapi.json">/openapi.json</a> are read-only and require no
      authentication.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
    <p>
      The site stores only a theme preference (<code>theme</code> in
      <code>localStorage</code>) to remember light/dark mode. No third-party
      advertising cookies are set. Search is local via Pagefind; queries never
      leave your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>
      External links (GitHub, LinkedIn, X, Hashnode, Google Scholar) are governed
      by their own policies. Embedded content is minimal by design. For questions,
      contact <a href="/contact">/contact</a> or email
      <a href="mailto:anuranroy02@gmail.com">anuranroy02@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes materially, the updated text will be published here
      with a revised date. Last updated: 2026-09-12.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
